+4. Explicit Contract – Inside each Task you must state ROLE / OBJECTIVE / INPUT / DELIVERABLE / OUTPUT_FORMAT.
+5. Step Review      – After every STEP_COMPLETE, re-plan: add, drop, reorder Tasks as discoveries dictate.
