-### High-Performance API Client
-
-```typescript
-import { 
-  createRateLimitMiddleware,
-  createCacheMiddleware,
-  createCircuitBreakerMiddleware,
-  createErrorHandlerMiddleware
-} from '@/lib/api/middlewares';
-
