-## 🏗️ Implemented Type Patterns
-
-### 1. Result Pattern
-```typescript
-type Result<T, E = Error> = 
-  | { success: true; data: T }
-  | { success: false; error: E };
-```
-
-### 2. Option Pattern
-```typescript
-type Option<T> = T | null | undefined;
-```
-
-### 3. Discriminated Unions
-```typescript
-type LoadingState<T> =
-  | { status: 'idle' }
-  | { status: 'loading' }
-  | { status: 'success'; data: T }
-  | { status: 'error'; error: Error };
-```
