-### Migration
-
-To migrate from @mastra/vector-pinecone:
-
-1. Remove @mastra/vector-pinecone from dependencies
-2. Install @mastra/pinecone
-3. Update imports from '@mastra/vector-pinecone' to '@mastra/pinecone'
